      },
      "text": "```\nFIELD: A commutative ring F where every nonzero element has a multiplicative inverse.\n  Equivalently: F is a commutative ring with at least two elements (0 ≠ 1),\n  and (F\\{0}, ×) is an abelian group."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md#006",
      "path": [
        "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields, git-history:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields]",
