        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Polynomials and Fields",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "PRIME FIELD:\n  char 0: contains Q as smallest subfield.\n  char p: contains F_p = Z/pZ as smallest subfield."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields, git-history:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields]",
