        "title": "Polynomials and Fields",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nF[x] for field F:\n  Euclidean domain with d(f) = deg(f).\n  → PID: every ideal is principal.\n  → UFD: unique factorization into irreducibles."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md#013",
      "path": [
        "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields, git-history:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields]",
        "canonical_path": "abstract-algebra/05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md",
        "concepts": "[polynomials, fields]",
        "current_path": "abstract-algebra/05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:abstract-algebra:polynomials-fields",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "abstract-algebra",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[polynomials, fields]",
        "section": "abstract-algebra",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Polynomials and Fields",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DIVISION ALGORITHM:\n  For f,g ∈ F[x], g ≠ 0: ∃! q,r: f = qg + r, deg(r) < deg(g) (or r=0)."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md#014",
      "path": [
        "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields, git-history:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields]",
        "canonical_path": "abstract-algebra/05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md",
        "concepts": "[polynomials, fields]",
        "current_path": "abstract-algebra/05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:abstract-algebra:polynomials-fields",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "abstract-algebra",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[polynomials, fields]",
        "section": "abstract-algebra",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Polynomials and Fields",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ROOT THEOREM (Factor Theorem):\n  c ∈ F is a root of f(x) iff (x-c) | f(x)."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md#015",
      "path": [
        "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields, git-history:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields]",
        "canonical_path": "abstract-algebra/05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md",
        "concepts": "[polynomials, fields]",
        "current_path": "abstract-algebra/05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md",
        "id": "maxim:abstract-algebra:polynomials-fields",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "abstract-algebra",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[polynomials, fields]",
        "section": "abstract-algebra",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Polynomials and Fields",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MULTIPLICITY:\n  c is a root of multiplicity m if (x-c)^m | f(x) but (x-c)^{m+1} ∤ f(x).\n  f has at most deg(f) roots in F (counting multiplicity).\n  Proof: deg(f) = n, and F[x] is a UFD."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md#016",
      "path": [
        "05-POLYNOMIALS-FIELDS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields, git-history:abstract-algebra:05-polynomials-fields]",
